🚛 Logistics Operations Performance Analysis
📊 Business Intelligence Project | Python + Power BI
📖 Overview

This project presents a complete Business Intelligence solution developed to analyze the operational performance of a transportation and logistics company between 2022 and 2024.

The project combines Python for data auditing and exploratory analysis with Power BI for data modeling, KPI development and interactive dashboard creation.

The objective is to transform operational data into actionable business insights that support strategic and operational decision-making.

🎯 Objectives

The main objectives of this project are:

Analyze the operational performance of a logistics company.
Identify trends in revenue, fleet utilization and logistics operations.
Evaluate driver performance and maintenance costs.
Develop an interactive Business Intelligence solution.
Support decision-making through KPIs and data visualization.
🗂 Dataset

The project uses the Synthetic Logistics Operations Database (2022–2024) published on Kaggle.

Source

Rodriguez, Y. (2025).

Synthetic Logistics Operations Database (2022–2024).

https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/yogape/logistics-operations-database

The dataset contains information about:

Customers
Drivers
Fleet
