📈 Dashboards

The solution consists of five interactive dashboards.

1️⃣ Executive Dashboard

Executive overview of the company's performance.

Main KPIs:
Revenue
Operating Margin
Loads
On-Time Deliveries
Revenue by Industry
Monthly Trends

2️⃣ Drivers Dashboard

Analysis of driver performance.

Main indicators:
Driver Incidents
Driver Responsibility
Average Idle Hours
Experience Analysis

3️⃣ Fleet Dashboard

Fleet utilization and maintenance analysis.

Includes:
Fleet Utilization
Maintenance Cost
Downtime
Vehicle Mileage
Maintenance Type Analysis

4️⃣ Logistics Dashboard

Network and logistics performance.

Main analyses:
Transit Time
Distance Analysis
Regional Operations
Distribution Centers
Logistics Network

5️⃣ Business Dashboard

Business performance analysis.

Includes:
Revenue
Operating Margin
Customer Analysis
Contract Types
Revenue Concentration

📌 Key Insights

The analysis identified several important findings:

Stable and profitable operations during the analyzed period.
Automotive is the main revenue-generating industry.
Opportunities to improve delivery punctuality.
Preventive maintenance represents a significant operational cost.
Nashville, Atlanta and Detroit are the main logistics hubs.
Revenue is concentrated in a limited number of customers.

